INFINITY TIE-IN &ndash; &quot;THE WORLD WE HAVE&quot;
The House of Black Bolt crumbles.
New friends, new enemies.

INFINITY TIE-IN!
Mobsters, aliens, broken promises, and now&hellip;THIS???
Things could not go more wrong for the Thunderbolts&hellip;

&quot;The World Breaks Everyone,&quot;
Part One of Two




<ul><li>Everything has been leading up to this momentous conclusion!</li><li>Morbius just found out The Rose has an Ultimate Nullifier in Brownsville.</li><li>The Rose just pressed the trigger.</li></ul>

