Issue #27 - THE EARTH-SHATTERING CONCLUSION TO &ldquo;NATURAL RESOURCES&rdquo;



Issue #28 - &ldquo;NATURAL RESOURCES&rdquo; AFTERMATH




<ul><li>The big battle for Utopia is here!</li><li>Finally, some answers about Psylocke&hellip;</li><li>When the dust clears, who will lead the mutant nation?</li><li>The Kitty Pryde/Jean Grey showdown begins here!</li><li>Utopia or Tian? Make your choice.</li><li>Can Mach Two rejoin the fold? Will she?</li></ul>

